== Introduction ==

In this document we will see how to build the platform with the component [[mico32_camera]].
The platform can be downloaded at the following address [http://svn.tuxfamily.org/svnroot/erika/erikae/repos/ee/trunk/ee/examples/mico32/demo/platforms/camera_debug_50/ svn]. 
Recall that to compile a platform is necessary Lattice tools [[http://www.latticesemi.com/products/designsoftware/isplever/isplever/index.cfm?source=sidebar ispLever]] and [[http://www.latticesemi.com/products/designsoftware/micodevelopmenttools/index.cfm MSB]].

=== Open Platform with MSB ===

Once downloaded the platform open the MSB Lattice tool.

